* Alternative design: fully differential TWO-stage Miller op amp (no nested loop).
* Stage 1: NMOS (LVT) differential pair; its PMOS loads take their gate from the
* resistive and capacitive midpoint of the two stage-1 outputs, so stage 1 sets
* its own common mode. Stage 2: PMOS common source per side, mirrored from the
* stage-1 loads. The output sinks are driven only by the common-mode feedback
* amplifier (five-transistor OTA with a 5 pF dominant-pole capacitor, mirrored
* into the sinks), so the CMFB acts on the output stage. One Miller capacitor
* with a series nulling resistor per side.
.subckt fd3_nmc_opamp vss ibias vdd vcm vinp vinn voutp voutn
XB0 ibias ibias vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=2 w=12.8 nf=4
XTAIL tail ibias vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=2 w=76.8 nf=24
XM1 o1n vinp tail vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8_lvt l=3 w=24 nf=6
XM2 o1p vinn tail vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8_lvt l=3 w=24 nf=6
XM3 o1n c1 vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8_lvt l=8 w=576 nf=144
XM4 o1p c1 vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8_lvt l=8 w=576 nf=144
R1A o1n c1 10meg
R1B o1p c1 10meg
C1A o1n c1 1p
C1B o1p c1 1p
XM5 voutp o1n vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8_lvt l=2 w=504 nf=126
XM6 voutn o1p vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8_lvt l=2 w=504 nf=126
XC5 voutp cmc vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=4 w=192 nf=48
XC6 voutn cmc vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=4 w=192 nf=48
RZP voutp zp 2k
CCP zp o1n 5p
RZN voutn zn 2k
CCN zn o1p 5p
RS1 voutp cms 2meg
RS2 voutn cms 2meg
CS1 voutp cms 2p
CS2 voutn cms 2p
XE0 te ibias vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=8 w=72 nf=18
XE1 ea vcm te vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8_lvt l=1 w=32 nf=8
XE2 eb cms te vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8_lvt l=1 w=32 nf=8
XE3 ea ea vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8_lvt l=1 w=4 nf=1
XE4 eb ea vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8_lvt l=1 w=4 nf=1
XE6 cmc eb vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8_lvt l=1 w=28 nf=7
XE5 cmc cmc vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=4 w=96 nf=24
CEB eb vdd 5p
.ends fd3_nmc_opamp
